    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01816",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“不嘛。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No, I won't.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01816",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "人家像一团火从老远赶来，你也该像一团火似的对待人家才是呀。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I came all this way burning like a ball of fire, so you ought to treat me with the same fire too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01816",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "她待男人转过身来，就用双手猛推男人的胸口，傲慢地挺起胸脯说，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When the man turned around, she shoved him hard in the chest with both hands, thrust out her chest proudly, and said,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01816",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "“我说不行嘛。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I told you, no.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01816",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我可不是白来的啊……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I did not come here for nothing...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01816",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "再说，又花火车费又花马车费的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Besides, I paid train fare and carriage fare too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
